    {
      "id": 56207,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-21T16:58:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My interpretation matches jagarciao's, that once she's been hit by \"a hero target\" (i.e. any hero target) then that's all she gets that turn.&nbsp; Just wanted to check other people's interpretations.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:31:10.502Z",
