      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>My interpretation matches jagarciao&#39;s, that once she&#39;s been hit by &quot;a hero target&quot; (i.e. any hero target) then that&#39;s all she gets that turn.&nbsp; Just wanted to check other people&#39;s interpretations.</p>",
